 />（5）参加活动用户完成符合活动主题项目的原理图和PCB设计即可获得优惠券支持，可选择<font color=\\\"#FF0000\\\">20元-50元PCB打板券、20-200元器件券、20元-50元3D打印券</font><br /><br />（6）需在专属活动页创建工程，项目默认开源展示（自选开源协议），已开源项目官方有权在其新媒体平台宣传展示<br /><br />（7）投稿项目须是原创项目，鼓励将符合活动主题的私有项目开源，无电路特性的项目不可投稿此活动，官方参考案例不可以进行复刻参赛<br /><br />（8）活动咨询：<a href=\\\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/d8d6f712619f49149cc1f181fbc69ffc.png\\\"><font color=\\\"#3232CD\\\"><b>【点击进入交流群】</b></font></a><br /><br />（9）<a href=\\\"https://docs.qq.com/doc/DTHhPZEx4ZkVDaHdo\\\"><b>点击查看活动流程文档</b></a><br /><br />（10）本活动最终解释权归立创开源硬件平台所有\",\"posts\":[],\"news\":[],\"lock_project_delete\":1,\"editor_version\":\"pro\",\"awards\":[{\"title\":\"一等奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/41d93d2d39c8417a9aea087935bf537f.png\",\"description\":\"乐鑫开发板 ESP32-S31-Korvo-1+500元京东E卡+荣誉证书+嘉立创EDA周边+300元器件券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/fed4849424d14fb5825f7faa82eb25af.png\"},{\"title\":\"二等奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/3d4aab0a52a0466a90d1258727032574.png\",\"description\":\"乐鑫开发板 ESP-VoCat 喵伴+300元京东E卡+荣誉证书+嘉立创EDA周边+200元器件券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/6369baf9cabf48d4989b442cb137a4e7.png\"},{\"title\":\"三等奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/2944c24b09c748eaa6fdc1f085734094.png\",\"description\":\"乐鑫开发板 ESP-DualKe+100元京东E卡+荣誉证书+嘉立创EDA周边+100元器件券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/95b8f44b8dac4799b5c07173aaac3c9b.png\"},{\"title\":\"鼓励奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/f2425825f1874103abcc4506cc970c0c.png\",\"description\":\"100元器件券+50元彩色丝印券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/4a53a6b1c31a4e36b3074ac730a12c58.png\"},{\"title\":\"参赛奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/0561ee65c8e843cd9e095bc71902c173.png\",\"description\":\"20-50元打样券\\n20-200元器件券\\n20-50元3D打印券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/a3458040750545e1accd29ef4f5423d1.png\"},{\"title\":\"结项奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/3d5477c884c74530839b83afc7886365.png\",\"description\":\"开源结项赠送50元彩色丝印券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/a3458040750545e1accd29ef4f5423d1.png\"}],\"is_shareLink\":0,\"is_payment\":0,\"open_course\":0,\"course_link\":\"\",\"link_copy\":\"\",\"coupons\":[\"\"],\"process\":[{\"title\":\"报名活动\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/09ceafeed08e47ffba3fbf473f0c07e4.png\",\"description\":\"报名参赛\"},{\"title\":\"设计制作\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/ecb83302fe6d4d5fbbb132f7f5b4c828.png\",\"description\":\"开启电子设计\"},{\"title\":\"审核发券\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7c549591a765497998f2b8d5c304d943.png\",\"description\":\"填写耗材申请表\"},{\"title\":\"评奖发奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/da06ec61c6a849eab09f049678478c43.png\",\"description\":\"官方颁奖\"}],\"invitation_description\":\"\",\"competition_type\":\"\",\"background_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/13918cc742ad43c8b29f3b961a22c0b9.png\",\"right_images\":[],\"activity_code_url\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/4559a94bb90a4ab692f518405d223d7d.png\",\"allow_sync_jlc\":1,\"hide_project\":0,\"external_page\":0},{\"uuid\":\"1c7d8876e23b4edda0f2acb7dc9c022b\",\"name\":\"开源造物・彩印赋能\",\"path\":\"opencolor\",\"type\":2,\"prefix\":\"\",\"project_default_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/3cd987f2a3a34ae4b7b3314a42932c10.png\",\"grade\":3000,\"status\":1,\"registration_start_time\":\"2026-03-18T16:00:00.000Z\",\"registration_end_time\":\"2026-05-30T16:00:00.000Z\",\"competing_start_time\":\"2026-03-17T16:00:00.000Z\",\"competing_end_time\":\"2026-05-31T16:00:00.000Z\",\"competition_origin\":\"oshwhub.com\",\"is_show\":1,\"index_show\":1,\"must_public\":1,\"transfer_code\":\"\",\"lock_project\":0,\"websiteSeo\":\"开源,PCB,彩色丝印,立创开源\",\"templateType\":\"1\",\"introduction\":\"开源是共享、是协作、是创新的基石。<br /><br />本次活动以免费彩色丝印券为载体，让每一份开源创意都能拥有更精致的呈现效果！<br /><br />活动期间，无需报名，在开源平台发布工程，即可获得50元PCB彩色丝印券！\",\"activityRules\":\"（1）即日起，只要在 [立创开源硬件平台] 开源工程，就送1张50元彩色丝印券，无需报名活动，发布就送！！<br /><br />（2）每人仅可领取1张，不可重复领取！<br /><br />（3）发布的项目通过开源审核即可（注：无电路设计元素、NFC卡片、洞洞板、工艺徽章、工程描述不完善的项目不支持，设计图需要用嘉立创EDA专业版设计，不支持其他软件导入的项目，已经领取过的用户不再重复赠送）<br /><br />发券时间：开源工程审核通过后系统自动发券<br />彩色券有效期：1个月<br />下单规格：10*10内，2层板，白色阻焊，沉金工艺\",\"posts\":[],\"news\":[],\"lock_project_delete\":0,\"editor_version\":\"pro\",\"awards\":[{\"title\":\"开源奖励\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/43695889015a4bbb8ad202a9d68e19f2.png\",\"description\":\"50元PCB彩色丝印优惠券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/584f6baeb05843b49687bdc349691a4b.png\"},{\"title\":\"优质工程奖励\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/108c82418f664d6b993efc73f1408e22.png\",\"description\":\"推荐参与星火计划或推荐投稿\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/7715dd28c98e402bbe71051ec838c4fe.png\"}],\"is_shareLink\":0,\"is_payment\":0,\"open_course\":0,\"course_link\":\"\",\"link_copy\":\"\",\"coupons\":[],\"process\":[{\"title\":\"设计制作\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b9d6e8ecc8864c33b3d13ec0594e7706.png\",\"description\":\"开启电子设计\"},{\"title\":\"发布开源\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/00e3cf28b78d43a6933d53d95fa5bf9c.png\",\"description\":\"完成设计并发布开源\"},{\"title\":\"领取奖励\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b701ea033c7c4109936baddb40f4477b.png\",\"description\":\"领取彩色丝印券\"}],\"invitation_description\":\"\",\"competition_type\":\"\",\"background_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/958d7b574ce448d58858b68fdd806fa8.jpg\",\"right_images\":[],\"activity_code_url\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/07a55f559f1941a19ee69c51ac57e3ea.jpg\",\"allow_sync_jlc\":0,\"hide_project\":0},{\"coupons\":[],\"name\":\"STC单片机开源创意电子设计大赛\",\"path\":\"STC32G144K246\",\"competition_type\":\"personal\",\"websiteSeo\":\"\",\"is_payment\":0,\"course_link\":\"\",\"open_course\":0,\"templateType\":\"1\",\"introduction\":\"基于下列官方推荐设计一款开发板或者是设计一个完整的电子产品项目。\\r\\n选手可以根据自己喜欢选择赛道（单片机赛道/项目赛道）\\r\\n\\r\\n单片机赛道：基于官方推荐的芯片去设计一个开发板\\r\\n\\r\\n项目赛道：基于官方推荐的芯片去设计一个完整的电子产品项目\\r\\n\\r\\n官方推荐芯片：STC32G144K246-LQFP100、Ai8051U-34K64-LQFP48/QFN48\",\"background_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/480192a1212e49b4964d1fc450867343.png\",\"right_images\":[\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/8adeb663d7904f3f8a3aa61086334a04.png\"],\"process\":[{\"title\":\"报名活动\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/09ceafeed08e47ffba3fbf473f0c07e4.png\",\"description\":\"报名创建工程\",\"grade\":4},{\"title\":\"设计制作\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/ecb83302fe6d4d5fbbb132f7f5b4c828.png\",\"description\":\"开启电子设计\",\"grade\":3},{\"title\":\"审核发券\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7c549591a765497998f2b8d5c304d943.png\",\"description\":\"填写领券表领券\",\"grade\":2},{\"title\":\"发布开源\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/f592debc64dc4dda8ae23e6a84fa52fe.png\",\"description\":\"完成活动项目并成功开源\",\"grade\":1}],\"awards\":[{\"title\":\"开发板区一等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/2bf85ae517c545a88a8d4497d40c6e6f.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b244b2f9f1194f0b8859abdc193b82bd.png\",\"description\":\"奖金500元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":8},{\"title\":\"项目区一等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/2bf85ae517c545a88a8d4497d40c6e6f.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/cc6475e913424e13bc6f0601970bc56d.png\",\"description\":\"奖金500元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":7},{\"title\":\"开发板区二等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/573cdf6906534e4bb955f9cef4c55924.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/aa2c55d9733e43fca83d64ed6e57cc1c.png\",\"description\":\"奖金300元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":6},{\"title\":\"项目区二等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/573cdf6906534e4bb955f9cef4c55924.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/aa2c55d9733e43fca83d64ed6e57cc1c.png\",\"description\":\"奖金300元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":5},{\"title\":\"开发板区三等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/8fce98d50c9d437bbca3bd259a17eff4.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7946aaf4f4cf4e98b1238080ee474114.png\",\"description\":\"奖金100元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":4},{\"title\":\"项目区三等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/8fce98d50c9d437bbca3bd259a17eff4.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7946aaf4f4cf4e98b1238080ee474114.png\",\"description\":\"奖金100元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":3},{\"title\":\"结项奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/eda85448382a4b40b6c7923b85133b72.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/bcfe310f67d24958ba90529815e669f6.png\",\"description\":\"耗材支持券包+无门槛50元彩色丝印券\",\"grade\":2},{\"title\":\"鼓励奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/4b3981f854a645ea8f7dbdf21e29daf5.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/965b3d55657d4f07ae326981833b1a24.png\",\"description\":\"无门槛50元器件券+无门槛50元彩色丝印券\",\"grade\":1}],\"activityRules\":\"<a href=\\\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/bcf916fde16044c3a9ebbc302d095d86.jpg\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>点击免费领取活动芯片！免费送</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（1）<a href=\\\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DTHhWTVR0TVVkYkdi?tab=BB08J2\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>点击填写报名领券表</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（2）案例参考：<a href=\\\"https://www.stcaimcu.com/thread-21275-1-1.html\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>芯片参考资料</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（3）限使用<FONT color=#FF0000>嘉立创EDA专业版</FONT>参与活动，标准版不支持，活动工程是默认开源\\r\\n（4）参加活动用户完成原理图和PCB设计即可获得优惠券支持，开发板赛道可选择<FONT color=#FF0000>20-50元打样券、20-50元器件券和20-50元3D外壳券</FONT>，项目赛道可选择<FONT color=#FF0000>20-50元打样券、20-100元器件券和20-50元3D外壳券</FONT>\\r\\n（5）投稿项目须是原创项目，鼓励将符合活动主题的私有项目开源，无电路特性的项目不可投稿此活动，官方参考案例不可以进行复刻参赛\\r\\n（6）已开源项目官方有权在其新媒体平台宣传展示\\r\\n（7）需在专属活动页创建工程，项目默认开源展示（自选开源协议）\\r\\n（8）评奖规则：采用官方评选，参与评选需要在活动期间内完成开源发布\\r\\n（9）活动咨询：<a href=\\\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/e06d95c222d14525a798b231db93a59e.png\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>【点击添加活动酱进交流群】</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（10）<a href=\\\"https://lceda002.feishu.cn/docx/KUmQdizcroJ9dYxrKHEcwR5hnLe\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>点击查看活动流程文档</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（11）本活动最终解释权归立创开源硬件平台所有\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"project_default_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b8d1fd8042b946d49566f6493fa61a70.png\",\"is_shareLink\":0,\"invitation_description\":\"\",\"activity_code_url\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/d23b40d8f631418fbf7fbdfd94b0457a.png\",\"must_public\":1,\"editor_version\":\"pro\",\"hide_project\":0,\"allow_sync_jlc\":0,\"lock_project\":0,\"lock_project_delete\":1,\"transfer_code\":\"6872487A\",\"status\":1,\"is_show\":1,\"index_show\":1,\"grade\":1700,\"link_copy\":null,\"competition_origin\":\"oshwhub.com\",\"type\":2,\"registration_start_time\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"registration_end_time\":\"2026-01-24T16:00:00.000Z\",\"competing_start_time\":\"2025-11-30T16:00:00.000Z\",\"competing_end_time\":\"2026-01-25T15:59:00.000Z\",\"posts\":[],\"news\":[],\"uuid\":\"507de84f1cc44d21bf1f3d2429e99e3c\"}]}}"},"redirectURL":"","headersSize":-1,"bodySize":-1,"_transferSize":12107,"_error":null,"_fetchedViaServiceWorker":false},"serverIPAddress":"127.0.0.1","startedDateTime":"2026-10-18T10:15:56.486Z","time":151.07199999329168,"timings":{"blocked":2.8079999986328184,"dns":-1,"ssl":-1,"connect":-1,"send":0.4460000000000002,"wait":128.46299999793712,"receive":19.354999996721745,"_blocked_queueing":1.3069999986328185,"_workerStart":-1,"_workerReady":-1,"_workerFetchStart":-1,"_workerRespondWithSettled":-1}},{"_connectionId":"130996","_initiator":{"type":"script","stack":{"callFrames":[{"functionName":"Bo.Ui.s